{
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Desc": "{0} is a young salamander, appearing in her later teens. Clad in {1}, she stands about six feet in height, with a lengthy, fiery tail swishing menacingly behind her. She's packing a {2}. Pacing around you, the well-built young warrior intently studies her mentor's defenses, readying for your next attack."
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Name": "Helspawn"
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Outfit.Modest": "a short skirt, thigh-high boots, and a sky-blue blouse, in stark contrast to her mother's sluttier attire"
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Outfit.Slutty": "a slutty scale bikini like her mother's, barely concealing anything"
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Weapon.Bow": "recurve bow, using blunted, soft-tipped arrows"
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Weapon.Scimitar": "scimitar, just like her mom's, and holds it in the same berserk stance Helia is wont to use"
  "Npcs.Helspawn.Weapon.Shield": "scimitar and shield, giving her a balanced fighting style"
}
